## S2. Joint carry: forward T-word to the peak, greedy G-word from the peak
[time] S2 loop 21.8s
S2.1 odd n <= 100000: 45281 records; 4719 skipped because M = n is a multiple of 3 (G undefined): first [21, 33, 45, 69, 81, 93, 117, 141]
S2.1 largest peak M = 523608245 at n = 77671; every greedy path from a peak reached 1 (cap 5000).
S2.1 carry formulas verified: B1 = sum_{i<=L1} 3^(L1-i) 2^(k_1+..+k_(i-1)), B2 = sum_{s<=J} 3^(s-1) 2^(K2-K_s), on every record.
