S3.3 negative cycle from -1: (K,L)=(1,1), 3^L/2^K = 3/2 > 1, so 3^j/2^{K_j} -> infinity along it.
S3.3 negative cycle from -4: (K,L)=(3,2), 3^L/2^K = 9/8 > 1, so 3^j/2^{K_j} -> infinity along it.
S3.3 positive cycle {1}: (K,L)=(2,1), 3^L/2^K = 3/4 < 1, ratio -> 0.
S3.4 capacity bound for a hypothetical G_- strip A <= 3^j/2^{K_j} <= B: images are coprime to 3, count <= 2X/3 + 1, giving B/A >= 9/2 (Collatz odd-and-coprime count gives 9).
